  "run_config_text": "# Lecoanet et al. (2016) smooth unstratified Kelvin--Helmholtz initial condition.\n# Exact IC: rho=1, p=10, u_flow=1, A=0.01, a=0.05, sigma=0.2,\n# y1=0.5, y2=1.5 on [0,1]x[0,2], with gamma=5/3 and periodic boundaries.\n# B=0, so ideal MHD reduces to inviscid hydrodynamics. This cfg supports an\n# early linear-growth reproduction only; it does not reproduce the paper's\n# nonlinear Re=1e5 viscous/thermal/dye reference solution.\ntest    = kelvin_helmholtz_lecoanet\nnx = 128\nny = 256\nxmin    = 0.0\nxmax    = 1.0\nymin    = 0.0\nymax    = 2.0\ngamma   = 1.6666666666666667\ncfl     = 0.4\nt_end = 0.25\nglm_cr  = 0.18\nbc      = periodic\nbc_y    = periodic\nriemann = hll\noutput_format = binary\noutput_file = C:/Users/tangy/Desktop/floatpoint/experiments/week19/lecoanet_kh_linear_reproduction/runs/t025/grid.bin\n",
